xE7nEDdQ5XkQ7kNvwECE73A&_nc_oc=Adrgo9aXRtvS7CDSsghdhARkOC3pyWQWqni3exMz71cLlRyt5r_qZCMjWDp5wMwZjkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJAFsYffldhfDZU7052XY1xGDJourv0pZfzb52Wf4v2RQ&oe=6AB13BB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OMp8sRcZpq0Q7kNvwHl25ET&_nc_oc=Adq599h3RUqnRMR31yutGXSKm2DTRMdgQ3WKbuCVUSvT-XDsbyFxGVhkk0dyYWwSccM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoMCxcDwCdaRvKBgCf43KPGLTTGzmZIW99JMMTRX8FRg&oe=6AB13D4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LAtzwYCz7-kQ7kNvwHQ5XL6&_nc_oc=AdrZEPlN3oczjCECPMlWZM8MFj5pUcdNWIe11XFVUhByHxqdz7pvr7yiCjvfWJLfql0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILOGb6ZMNK5E5n23JhOC_DJ9MucIiTLF2W1kW6wBfgpQ&oe=6AB12A6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zqhv-UpuVFsQ7kNvwEsgrwb&_nc_oc=Adrk8NGYuTdcOcpYq-Wya3_gc8ZxZub2SBmgnUFvOsfhskcAz6RNJbxLBAsD9r78Axg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJzKjVmNZvVmAng7pqUNXuZo9kDstJPytG2jx1tfOE0Mg&oe=6AB14C03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qlBjkeEQ7DIQ7kNvwEWQe_w&_nc_oc=Adr4XD-ka8bArDiG-ydfSRhZLHBnK2sE0FqoLwycUaNFTC82vBIyPKrrzYi_A4fzu40&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLML6u2Vu2GWaeOSbnX8pbbU6pvAdTsq2JLhHgFuTLs_Q&oe=6AB14458"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MlwHhKqdK-gQ7kNvwFWMTGM&_nc_oc=AdqiO3rQlGymsbCdV2W_p4iUjc3j_UI9pmaUuLuFyeLCDeT0Lba1Kx3qe_7HcJ0hcNU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKuCH56rxwxXaQ5AtQZq3uRueCW6GT32EQn8688xBVVew&oe=6AB1577C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080